8. TEST-ONLY AND TOOL-ONLY SOURCES (not shipped)
==============================================================================

- pyerfa (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2011-2023 PyERFA Developers): reference
  values in public test fixtures (frames, frames_ext, horizons, obliquity,
  stars/erfa.json, time).
- jplephem (MIT, Brandon Rhodes): direct DE441/DE442 evaluation for
  tests/fixtures/pack and pack builders.
