  kept in the private test corpus; not distributed.
- NASA eclipse canons (section 4.3): tests/fixtures/eclipses/extras.json.
- pyswisseph / Swiss Ephemeris (AGPL-3.0 or Swiss Ephemeris
  Professional Licence): used ONLY as a black-box oracle through its public
  API to measure compatibility. It is not a dependency, no Swiss code or data
  file is read or shipped, and every file containing its outputs is kept in
  the private corpus (private/oracle/, see tools/privatize_oracle_fixtures.py).


